### Health + stats (no auth)
GET http://localhost:8088/healthz

### Service manifest (no auth)
GET http://localhost:8088/

### Remember a fact
POST http://localhost:8088/memory
Authorization: Bearer klaro26_dev_key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "The user prefers dark mode and terse replies.",
  "namespace": "user-42",
  "metadata": { "source": "onboarding" }
}

### Remember another
POST http://localhost:8088/memory
Authorization: Bearer klaro26_dev_key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "The user is building an open-source API company called Klaro26.",
  "namespace": "user-42"
}

### Recall by meaning
POST http://localhost:8088/memory/recall
Authorization: Bearer klaro26_dev_key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "what is the user working on?",
  "namespace": "user-42",
  "k": 3
}

### Fetch one memory (paste an id)
GET http://localhost:8088/memory/PASTE_ID
Authorization: Bearer klaro26_dev_key

### Forget one memory (paste an id)
DELETE http://localhost:8088/memory/PASTE_ID
Authorization: Bearer klaro26_dev_key
